# Target C: maximal replacement-functional rank in the eight-no-root `k=6` residual

Date: 2026-09-22

Status: rigorous strengthening of the remaining eight-no-root `k=6` layer. It does not close either surviving arithmetic root branch, but it replaces the capacity-only endpoint by a maximal-rank condition: every surviving global profile must fill its entire replacement-functional quotient. In the `D=-2,p=8` branch, the eight global singleton replacement functionals must be independent, and every three-clean seven-row shadow must fill a seven-dimensional quotient.

